.TH "gtk4-query-settings" "1" "" "GTK" "GTK commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
gtk4-query-settings \- Print name and value of GTK settings
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
\fBgtk4\-query\-settings\fP [PATTERN]
.fi
.sp
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBgtk4\-query\-settings\fP prints both name and value of all properties available
in the \fBGtkSettings\fP class. Optionally, you can filter which properties to
list by specifying a \fBPATTERN\fP\&.
.\" End of generated man page.
